<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Pod 生命周期 on 断念梦的站点</title><link>https://desistdaydream.github.io/docs/10.%E4%BA%91%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F/Kubernetes/Pod/Pod-%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%9F/</link><description>Recent content in Pod 生命周期 on 断念梦的站点</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><atom:link href="https://desistdaydream.github.io/docs/10.%E4%BA%91%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F/Kubernetes/Pod/Pod-%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%9F/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Pod 生命周期与探针</title><link>https://desistdaydream.github.io/docs/10.%E4%BA%91%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F/Kubernetes/Pod/Pod-%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%9F/Pod-%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%8E%E6%8E%A2%E9%92%88/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://desistdaydream.github.io/docs/10.%E4%BA%91%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F/Kubernetes/Pod/Pod-%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%9F/Pod-%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%8E%E6%8E%A2%E9%92%88/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="概述"&gt;概述&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#%e6%a6%82%e8%bf%b0" aria-label="Heading self-link"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
